dem-deep-sexp.gls -- dem-deep-sexp.scm

The file: (define deep, then 20,000 lines "(level-NNNNN "ção" N" each
opening one level, then one line of 20,001 ) that closes them all, then
(define after-deep 42).  So the first s-expression is 20,000 levels deep
and well closed.

Open:   chezweb dem-deep-sexp.scm

1. C-M-f                 at the start
   Expect: the cursor after the last ) of the long line, before
   (define after-deep 42), within 2 s.
2. C-M-b                 Expect: back at the start, within 2 s.
3. M-g 10001 RET  C-M-u
                         (backward-up-list) Expect: the cursor on the (
                         of line 10000, at once.
4. C-M-f                 from that ( Expect: the cursor after its matching
                         ) in the long line, within 2 s.
5. M-g 3 RET  TAB      Expect: the line indented under (level-00001,
                         at once (indentation reads only what it needs).
6. C-/                   Expect: the indentation undone.
7. M->  C-M-b  C-M-b     Expect: (define after-deep 42) then the whole
                         (define deep ...) selected by motion: the cursor at
                         the start of the file, within 2 s each.
8. C-x k RET, then "y" if asked: do not save.
